OL,3,GNEWSAVigilante warning as man in van
OL,4,Aapproaches children
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have been warned not take the
OL,7,Flaw into their own hands if they mount
OL,8,Fpatrols after reports that a man in a
OL,9,Fvan has been approaching children.
OL,11,FPolice are investigating three recent
OL,12,Freports involving a man in a
OL,13,Fdark-coloured Transit van in the
OL,14,FMetheringham and Scopwick areas of
OL,15,FLincolnshire.
OL,17,FLincolnshire Police said it was aware
OL,18,Fof discussions about residents
OL,19,Fundergoing patrols in response to the
OL,20,Fincidents.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
